            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.39+LEV.23.40+LEV.23.41+LEV.23.42+LEV.23.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 23.39-43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maze uzarokoka mu mahanga yose yateraga i Yerusalemu wese azajya azamuka uko umwaka utashye, ajye gusenga Umwami Uwiteka Nyiringabo, ajye no mu minsi mikuru y'ingando. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko umuntu wese wo mu miryango yose yo mu isi, utazazamuka ngo ajye i Yerusalemu gusenga Umwami Uwiteka Nyiringabo, iwabo ntihazagusha imvura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ishyanga rya Egiputa niritazamuka ngo rize na bo ntibazagusha imvura, na ho hazaba icyago Uwiteka ateza amahanga yanga kuzamuka ngo ajye mu minsi mikuru y'ingando. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icyo kizaba igihano Abanyegiputa bazahanwa, n'amahanga yose yanga kuzamuka ngo ajye mu minsi mikuru y'ingando.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo munsi ku nzogera z'amafarashi hazaba handitsweho ngo: Cyerejwe Uwiteka, kandi inkono zo mu nzu y'Uwiteka zizamera nk'inzabya zo ku gicaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
